OL,3,GNEWSA'Keep windows closed' warning as
OL,4,Acrews tackle fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living near a fire which has
OL,7,Fbeen tackled by crews in North
OL,8,FYorkshire overnight have been advised
OL,9,Fto keep doors and windows closed as
OL,10,Fwork to put it out continues.
OL,12,FCrews were called to reports of wood
OL,13,Fwaste on fire on Heck and Pollington
OL,14,FLane, near Great Heck, at 23:41 BST on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
