OL,1,W5j 5Quzj#5w;jp%p05 jj#57+
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%%** %  -,** %-. (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Keep windows closed' warning as
OL,4,Acrews tackle fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,F(NYFRS) said a fire of about 323 sq ft
OL,8,F(30 sq m) was being fought by crews
OL,9,Ffrom across the county, including
OL,10,Fappliances from Selby, Harrogate,
OL,11,FThirsk and Richmond. Crews from
OL,12,FHumberside and South Yorkshire also
OL,13,Fattended.
OL,15,FThe fire was in a pile of wood waste
OL,16,Fapprox 30m by 200m and the fire service
OL,17,Fsaid it was expected they would be at
OL,18,Fthe scene through the morning.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
